      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokio%2C_Texas"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "In 1928 the community moved one mile south to stay connected with the U.S. rail line, a move that kept the town alive for decades.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5,
        23,
        27
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
