        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tokio%2C_Texas"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "By 2000 only 24 residents remained, leaving weathered buildings that now tell the story of a once-thriving farming community.",
