      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://unitedstatesghosttowns.com/tokio-texas-ghost-town/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A historical marker stands in front of the old Tokio School, commemorating the town’s educational heritage.",
